### 1. The `LICENSE` or `LICENSE.md` File
Copy and paste the standard, unmodified text of the **GNU Affero General Public License v3.0** into your `LICENSE` or `LICENSE.md` file in the root of your repository. 

You can grab the full official plain text directly from GNU:
* [https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt)

